# Hands: choosing from the actions wheel. With the tools wheel up, a click of the left stick turns it into the actions wheel
# (opened where the left hand is); the left stick picks an entry and letting go of the grip uses it. The first entry, straight
# up, is Inventory; Dampeners is the next, one sector clockwise.
# World: Earth Planet (survival, on foot, in gravity). Nothing is built. The wheel has as many sectors as entries (see the
# "Actions wheel: opened" line, "N entries"): the angle for Dampeners below assumes 16 and is tuned from that line.

plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet

# ---- What the world needs: the dampeners on, so the Dampeners entry has something to switch off ---------------------------------

dampeners on
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60

head 0 1.6 0
hand left -0.25 1.2 -0.3
hand right 0.25 1.2 -0.3
wait 1
read character
expect dampeners == true

# ---- Dampeners: the entry next to the top one, 360/16 = 22.5 degrees clockwise -> the dampeners go off ---------------------------

press left grip
wait 1
press left stick
wait 0.2
release left stick
wait 1
read screen
expect type == ActionsWheelScreen
stick left 0.383 0.924
wait 0.7
release left grip
wait 0.3
stick left 0 0
wait 1.5
expect log Actions wheel: picked Toggle Dampeners within 5
read character
expect dampeners == false

# ---- Inventory: the top entry, straight up -> the inventory screen opens ----------------------------------------------------------

press left grip
wait 1
press left stick
wait 0.2
release left stick
wait 1
stick left 0 1
wait 0.7
release left grip
wait 0.3
stick left 0 0
wait 1.5
expect log Actions wheel: picked Inventory within 5
read screens
expect result contains MyGuiScreenTerminal
press right b
wait 0.2
release right b
wait 1.5
read screen
expect type == MyGuiScreenGamePlay
expect no log Exception
